id: frame-field
section: Keyboard and text
item: A field inside a frame (jihad-frame-field.html): a tap raises the keyboard, typed keys land in it (the frame's picture changes), the hide key drops it and no caret is left (the frame's picture holds still), a tap brings it back
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-frame-field.html
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R4
wait rect f 20
calibrate outer
tap-off f 100 90
expect keyboard up 8
expect visible f
sample frame f
type-keys ab
wait differs f frame 5
expect region-changed f frame
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
wait still f 3
sample rest f
wait still f 3
expect region-equal f rest
tap-off f 100 90
expect keyboard up 8
